{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-water-way","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-water-way-prestige-one-bukadra","about":"The Water Way is a luxury project by developer Prestige One. Elegant 18-storey residential complex, located in the new family-oriented community Meydan Horizon in MBR City area. The facades are designed in a modern style with sleek lines. Exclusive apartments with 1, 2 bedrooms, as well as luxury penthouses are presented for sale. The interiors are made in a modern style with the use of neutral shades, which creates a cozy atmosphere. Panoramic windows are filled with sunlight, which visually expands the space and offers spectacular views of the Ras Al Khor Nature Reserve and beautiful lagoons.Premium world-class amenities are provided for residents, including a gym, recreational areas, a movie theater, and a barbecue area. The residential complex has a crystal clear lagoon with a landscaped beach, along which there is a promenade with a walking path and a bicycle path. The complex is close to a variety of amenities of the modern community: cafes, restaurants, retail outlets, medical facilities, schools.The Water Way is located 5 minutes from Ras El Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, 15 minutes to Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall and Business Bay, approximately 20 minutes to Dubai Hills Golf Club and Dubai Creek Golf and Yacht Club, and Dubai International Airpor, only 20 minutes.","price":1927200,"title":"The Water Way","bitrix":{"id":814,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Water Way","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Water Way","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Prestige One","project_location":"Bukadra"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1218/images/2024/03/06/340x252/92XjBiyIZ9pzsJbRXfSNgkC9OzwRfWbgxRKrcQlq.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1218/images/2024/03/06/464x312